{
  "slug": "revensi",
  "name": "Revensi",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A 12-skill audit suite that simulates how AI buying agents (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity) read a B2B SaaS site, then write a prioritized gap report that your repair agents can close.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `about-audit` (Use when the user wants to audit an About, Team, Company, or Leadership page for AI/LLM readability, when…), `agent-page` (Use when the user wants to build, generate, or audit an /for-ai-agents, /llms, /ai, /agents, or \"for AI\"…), `buyer-context` (Use when the user wants to define, generate, or update their buyer/ICP/positioning context document for AI-readability audits, when…), `case-study-audit` (Use when the user wants to audit a case study, customer story, success story, or customers index page…), `comparison-audit` (Use when the user wants to audit a /vs/ or comparison page — pages where their product is…), `competitor-audit` (Use when the user wants to audit a competitor's site through the same AI/LLM-readability lens as their own…), `crawler-audit` (Use when the user wants to check whether AI crawlers (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, Google-Extended, Applebot-Extended, etc.) can reach…), `faq-audit` (Use when the user wants to audit a FAQ, frequently-asked-questions, or help-center entry page for AI/LLM readability), and 4 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install revensi@claude-community` from `RevensiAI/buyer-context`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
